#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""agenttop - htop-style monitor for GitHub Copilot sessions and subagents.

Data sources: Copilot CLI ~/.copilot/session-state/*/events.jsonl and the
Agent Host Protocol (AHP) JSONL trace that VS Code writes live to
    ~/Library/Application Support/Code*/logs/<launch>/ahp/ahp-*.jsonl
(Linux: ~/.config/Code*/logs/...). Every `task` delegation, every write_agent/read_agent
call and every "agent completed" system notification passes through that stream, so the
full lifecycle of each parallel background agent can be reconstructed without touching
any private API.

Usage:
    agenttop                 # live TUI
    agenttop --once          # single plain-text snapshot
    agenttop --json          # machine readable snapshot
    agenttop --log <file|dir>
"""

